# Kiln model catalog
#
# Fields (pipe separated):
#   repo | file | size_gb | min_vram_gb | min_ram_gb | tags
#
# size_gb is the on-disk size. min_vram_gb / min_ram_gb are guidance for
# comfortable inference at the default 65536 context AND the default q8_0 KV
# cache type, not hard limits. Raising KILN_CTX or setting KILN_KV_TYPE=f16
# increases these substantially; see docs/HARDWARE.md.
#
# Tags are free-form and used for filtering and for the hardware-based
# recommendation. A "0" in min_vram_gb means the file is an auxiliary asset
# (a vision projector) that is loaded alongside a model, not run on its own.
#
# Only formats the pinned PrismML fork can actually load are listed here.
# See docs/MODELS.md for the compatibility matrix and for formats that are
# deliberately excluded (MLX, GSQ-RCO, NInfer, AWQ).
#
# Community entries are unvalidated by upstream. They are listed because they
# exist and are popular, not because they have been tested by this project.

